ency at Scale: NVIDIA, Energy Leaders Accelerating Power‑Flexible AI Factories to Fortify the Grid',NULL,'CERAWeek — dubbed the Davos of energy — is where policymakers, producers, technologists and financiers gather to discuss how the world powers itself next. NVIDIA and Emerald AI unveiled at the conference last week a new way forward — treating AI factories not as static power loads but as flexible, intelligent grid assets. This collaboration [&#8230;]',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/energy-efficiency-ai-factories-grid/','2026-03-31 15:00:51.000','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543'),(83,'fcfb182b9981ceaadf7b1ac6d0800e147a146bd18bab1a83243ab50367e4df9c','NVIDIA Blog','Into the Omniverse: NVIDIA GTC Showcases Virtual Worlds Powering the Physical AI Era',NULL,'Editor’s note: This post is part of Into the Omniverse, a series focused on how developers, 3D practitioners, and enterprises can transform their workflows using the latest advances in OpenUSD and NVIDIA Omniverse. NVIDIA GTC last week showcased a turning point in physical AI: Robots, vehicles and factories are scaling from single use cases and [&#8230;]',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/gtc-2026-virtual-worlds-physical-ai/','2026-03-26 15:00:56.000','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543'),(84,'76db64f677eddd91cc6f22d0bd60c89efb80385a608f3cdece48db528f8081b1','NVIDIA Blog','Game On: Five New Titles Now Streaming on GeForce NOW',NULL,'That gaming backlog won’t clear itself — GeForce NOW is here to help. Stream the latest titles straight from the cloud across a variety of devices. This week, five new titles are ready to play instantly in the cloud gaming platform’s library. Screamer drifts onto the scene with retro‑racing attitude and pixel‑perfect speed. Plus, Honkai: Star Rail Version [&#8230;]',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/geforce-now-thursday-screamer/','2026-03-26 13:00:47.000','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543'),(85,'1cb7a270a29f860eb9baefc22975e223d0706d3a02bb1d4b329bec3b8ad5e515','NVIDIA Blog','The Future of AI Is Open and Proprietary',NULL,'AI is the defining technology of our time, quickly becoming core business infrastructure. It’s fueled by a diverse ecosystem of models: large and small, open and proprietary, generalist and specialist. This variety is essential for a future where every application will be powered by AI, every country will build it and every company will use [&#8230;]',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/ai-future-open-and-proprietary/','2026-03-25 19:00:04.000','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543'),(86,'9abf7ab0acd4af62d70d7fffa63fc333909b9f540951f407e4d614c521b04e6b','NVIDIA Blog','Blowing Off Steam: How Power-Flexible AI Factories Can Stabilize the Global Energy Grid',NULL,'At the half-time whistle of the UEFA EURO 2020 round of 16 football match between England and Germany, millions of viewers stepped away from their screens in the U.K. to do the same thing at the same time — turn on their kettles. National Grid, which provides electricity for England and Wales, saw a demand [&#8230;]',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/power-flexible-ai-factories-energy-grid/','2026-03-25 11:00:00.000','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543'),(87,'854c8dabece7901ad5b45ab1e3d67b2194032fa29dcc0a1b2a676d525303dde0','NVIDIA Blog','Advancing Open Source AI, NVIDIA Donates Dynamic Resource Allocation Driver for GPUs to Kubernetes Community',NULL,'Artificial intelligence has rapidly emerged as one of the most critical workloads in modern computing. For the vast majority of enterprises, this workload runs on Kubernetes, an open source platform that automates the deployment, scaling and management of containerized applications. To help the global developer community manage high-performance AI infrastructure with greater transparency and efficiency, [&#8230;]',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-at-kubecon-2026/','2026-03-24 08:00:12.000','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543'),(88,'2f70f9cd7914e5bbd35cea0cb4c679afdcbf446640da2b484ef4bd65c0734a80','NVIDIA Blog','How Autonomous AI Agents Become Secure by Design With NVIDIA OpenShell',NULL,'Autonomous agents mark a new inflection point in AI. Systems are no longer limited to generating responses or reasoning through tasks. They can take action: Agents can read files, use tools, write and run code, and execute workflows across enterprise systems, all while expanding their own capabilities. Application-layer risk grows exponentially when agents continuously improve [&#8230;]',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/secure-autonomous-ai-agents-openshell/','2026-03-23 15:00:03.000','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543','2026-04-23 09:05:07.543'),(89,'e11d2160389500cd36cf95a3d200c225f3e55ef69d109ed19e00cfbee646ac0e','OpenAI News','GPT-5.5 System Card',NULL,'',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-5-system-card','2026-04-23 11:00:00.000','2026-04-24 01:05:07.336','2026-04-24 01:05:07.336'),(90,'fb5140805819fe6c0f8b783f56fe840d8c4b60405381eab8531346733c254f79','OpenAI News','Introducing GPT-5.5',NULL,'Introducing GPT-5.5, our smartest model yet—faster, more capable, and built for complex tasks like coding, research, and data analysis across tools.',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-5-5','2026-04-23 11:00:00.000','2026-04-24 01:05:07.336','2026-04-24 01:05:07.336'),(91,'9bba3cbeb5290554f439d5a11a56200561c5e7b78eca98498ad7af528ac6c46d','OpenAI News','What is Codex?',NULL,'Learn how Codex helps you go beyond chat by automating tasks, connecting tools, and producing real outputs like docs and dashboards.',NULL,'pending',NULL,'https://openai.com/academy/what-is-codex','2026-04-23 10:00:00.000','2026-04-24 01:05:07.336','2026-04-24 01:05:07.336'),(92,'2bd4a66d0b67db99e0628092c49e4249cef518e7d3474872b4e82935f52824dd','OpenAI News','Automations',NULL,'Learn ho